# Isolated, quarantined ScraperAI virtualenv (GPL-3.0 + legacy pinned deps —
# NEVER part of the deployed backend). Recreate with: make-venv in run_harvest.sh
.venv-scraper/

# Run artifacts + local progress state (raw harvest, seen-set, skip-list) and
